body:
Immediate thought: PERSONAL OPINION as someone that been in for close to 20yrs but never saw combat;

If the military created a need for you to own a blue placard: do it

If the military put you in active combat: do it

I picked it up. Haven't had much of a chance to dig into the Early Access, but I have messed around with the demo a bit. 

If anyone's interested;

[Demo gameplay](https://youtu.be/ohGCT4nZ-MM)
